<title>UK: RMC hikes stake in Austria's Kies.</title>
<headline>RMC hikes stake in Austria's Kies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>RMC Group Plc said on Monday that it had increased its shareholding in Austria's Kies-Union Vereinigte Kieswerke AG to 54.99 percent.</p>
<p>In a statement, RMC said it was also merging Kies-Union with its own subsidiary, Lieferbeton AG (LAG) with effect from December 1, 1996.  </p>
<p>The merger involves the disposal of RMC's holding in LAG to Kies-Union in exchange of shares. After the merger RMC would hold 72 percent in the issued share capital of Kies-Union and LAG will become its wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Kies-Union will be renamed Readymix Kies Union AG after the merger.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
